{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>The name of the first is Pishon.</b> He informs us of the excellence of the river that waters the garden — which is unknown to us — by informing us of the rivers that branch off from it, which are known to us, in praise of their greatness, the goodness of their waters, and the goodness of their fruit."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:28:40.518284772Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}